# E-learning Certificate
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: E-learning — a rendered document generated from a template + the
# Enrollment's data. The new pattern this case exists to surface: generating a
# FILE from a template is different from storing an uploaded one (CAP-F06) or
# creating a structured record (CAP-A06).
# Case 21 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: elearning-enrollment.menata

Certificate

Fields

- Enrollment : Enrollment
- Certificate Number : Text
- Issued At : Date
- Generated File : File

Constraints

- Enrollment is required.

Permissions

Student

- View

Views

- My Certificates : List
- Certificate Detail : Detail
